# Internal CA Windows backend continuation — closeout

A bounded Windows public CSR validation callback and conservative CNG result classification were implemented after exact official review. The portable core, CNG key owner, same-root persistence and CURRENT/A/P/checkpoint behavior are preserved. The overall backend task remains partial: no productive signer is registered, complete CSR/X509 construction remains pending and runtime attachment is denied by resource/qualification gates.

See [proof and handoff](implementation-proof-and-handoff.md), [ED11 census](ed11-census.json), source-operations.json, test-fopen-operation.json and final-manifest.json. Initial warning/failure logs are preserved; final focal builds are clean. No new native key attempt was performed.

